<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0"><kbd style="margin-left:18pt"></kbd>Indicate by check mark whether the registrant is a shell company (as defined in Rule 12b-2 of the Exchange Act). &#160;Yes&#160;<ix:nonNumeric name="dei:EntityShellCompany" contextRef="D260101_260630" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" id="ixv-6591">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric> &#160;&#160;No&#160;<span style="font-family:Wingdings">x</span>&#160;</p>
