</td><td valign="top" style="width:63.8pt"><p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0;text-align:center">31.5%</p>
</td><td valign="top" style="width:63.8pt"><p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0;text-align:center">30.6%</p>
</td><td valign="top" style="width:63.75pt"><p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0;text-align:center">30.7%</p>
