</td><td valign="top" style="width:49.5pt"><p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0;text-align:right">-&#160;</p>
</td><td valign="top" style="width:58.5pt;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000"><p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0;text-align:right">-&#160;</p>
